  # System architecture
| {near: top-center}

officer: |md
  **Credit officer**

  enters applications in a browser
| {shape: rectangle; class: actor}
client: |md
  **API client**

  sends JSON over HTTPS
| {shape: rectangle; class: actor}
service: "Credit Risk Scorecard service, one container" {
  class: group
  ui: |md
    **Web UI**

    static HTML, CSS and JavaScript
  | {shape: rectangle; class: box}
  api: |md
    **REST API**

    FastAPI routes and request validation
  | {shape: rectangle; class: box}
  scoring: |md
    **Scoring service**

    WOE pipeline, logistic regression,

    score scaling and risk grades
  | {shape: rectangle; class: key}
  artifacts: |md
    **Model artifacts**

    pipeline, model and metadata
  | {shape: rectangle; class: box}
  ui -> api: "POST /api/v1/predict" {style.stroke: "#556270"; style.font-color: "#556270"; style.font-size: 15}
  api -> scoring: "validated application" {style.stroke: "#556270"; style.font-color: "#556270"; style.font-size: 15}
  scoring -> artifacts: "loads once at startup,\nverifies checksums" {style.stroke: "#556270"; style.font-color: "#556270"; style.font-size: 15}
}

